+                    : NativeDVLowLatencyOverStandard()
+                        ? ", as Dolby Vision Low-Latency, which the settings ask for also where the "
+                          "display takes Dolby Vision Standard (\"Low-Latency also where the TV takes "
+                          "Standard\" is on), the picture mapped to the display by LibreELEC Hades"
+                        : ", as Dolby Vision Low-Latency (the display offers no other), the picture "
